		        <section class="sc_fs_faq sc_card ">
            <div>
				<h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Are_sea-facing_apartments_in_Worli_strong_investments"></span>Are sea-facing apartments in Worli strong investments?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2>                <div>
					                    <p>
						Yes, sea-facing apartments in Worli are strong investments as they consistently outperform the wider market, supported by premium demand and steady appreciation – including 30% growth between 2022 and 2024 and 20% growth in the past year.                    </p>
                </div>
