		        <section class="sc_fs_faq sc_card ">
            <div>
				<h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="What_makes_ready_possession_sea-facing_apartments_in_Worli_special"></span>What makes ready possession sea-facing apartments in Worli special?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2>                <div>
					                    <p>
						Ready possession sea-facing apartments in Worli are special because they offer reduced project risk, strong rental potential, and immediate access to full sea panoramas.                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
		        <section class="sc_fs_faq sc_card ">
